<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "in_dream.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>How long had I been asleep?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The room was already pitch dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had I really slept that long?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked all around, but I couldn't see anything at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I should at least have been able to see the faint lights of the computer and the TV.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where's <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>? What time is it? Huh?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And then, before my eyes, a cherry tree in full bloom, floating in the pitch-black darkness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no wind, and the petals fell fluttering straight down.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\うめき声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Nn... ngh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Coming from somewhere, a moaning voice I couldn't tell was a man's or a woman's.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where on earth was this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd seen it before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This place was Central Park, in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The scene where the incident from earlier had supposedly happened...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When spring comes, countless cherry trees bloom riotously here, and the place <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="にぎ">bustles</STYLE> with crowds of people.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\御神木.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The great towering cherry tree is the one called the goshinboku, in Central Park.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even in Motoki-cho, with all its cherry trees, it's an especially big tree, and it blooms with flowers truly <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="こうごう">divine</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="まがまが">ominous</STYLE>.<PG>
Even though it was the season, there was hardly a sign of anyone at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\うめき声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Except for the moaning coming from somewhere―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where was this voice coming from?
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
When I looked beneath the goshinboku, something shaped like a person was lying there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking closely, I saw it was faintly squirming.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No doubt about it, the moaning was that person's.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The voice sounded in terrible pain, but there was no one around to call to for help.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hurried, running up close.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "2000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤人.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was struck speechless for a moment by that person's bizarre appearance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That person's form was bright red.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A bright-red human being lay collapsed there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't tell the features, or the age, or even the sex.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But alive! Still alive!<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you all right?! I'll call an ambulance right away!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\うめき声2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Nnngh... aah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Reacting to my voice, the red person stirred.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every second counted.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "2000" "PASS"}
Just then, a strong wind blew through between us and the goshinboku.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Bright-red cherry blossoms pouring down from the goshinboku whirled around me.
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
But what touched my skin was not the light brush that petals should give.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A sticky, faintly cold, unpleasant <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ひまつ">spatter</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>No... these aren't flowers!<PG>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "赤い雨.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<TXSPN>Blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Blood was pouring down like rain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What? This..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My whole body was rapidly being painted over in a murky, blackish red.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\夢の目.lcm" "REPEAT" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\夢の目1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "669" "262" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "人物2" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "1"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Keeping my face turned up, I slowly moved only my eyeballs downward.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the first time, I saw the red person's face clearly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The bright-red human was looking back at me, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Bloodshot eyes opened wide, as though, unable to speak, trying instead to tell me something with a fierce look―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if caught in sleep paralysis, I could no longer move.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll... get help right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESON "500"}
My legs finally began to move, and I drew one foot back a step.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\つかもう.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "-900" "C" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\nつかむ手\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\nつかむ手\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\つかむ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ドーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly, the bright-red human grabbed my ankle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Such strength...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "0" "15" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I wanted to shake it off, but I wasn't strong enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt a cold sweat running down my back.<PG>
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Stop...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I said that―<PG>
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\雑魚.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "300"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\赤顔.lmt" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家時計0時0000.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\時計の時報.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シナリオ\000過去へ馳せる夢\時計11回.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Huh...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I opened my eyes, I was on the sofa at <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
A dream...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> seemed to be online.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> didn't seem particularly concerned about me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did that mean I'd been sleeping soundly, even through a dream like that?<PG>
There was no feel of the cold sweat I thought had run down my back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The feeling of my ankle being grabbed was still there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that was probably because I'd had my ankles crossed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I uncrossed and recrossed them, the feeling of being grabbed soon went away too.<PG>
It seemed it had been a dream, through and through.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I turned my eyes to the TV.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently it was the high school's message board, the one I'd objected to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> hadn't noticed that I'd woken up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The board, as expected, seemed to be filled with talk of this morning's incident.<PG>
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\掲示板.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\pc_keyboard.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
